
Papa i: ['product'] hana: {
	>> total := 1.
	iho pākahi: { :index :element
		total hoʻonui-me: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Papa ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
Huapuka kākau: a product, laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: (Papa ← 2 ; 4 ; 8) product, laina-hou. 
Huapuka kākau: (Papa ← -2 ; 10) product, laina-hou. 
Huapuka kākau: (Papa ← 0.5 ; -2) product, laina-hou. 
